Subject: [PATCH] Add EndpointSlice permissions for CloudNativePG 1.28.4

CloudNativePG 1.28.4 backports the CNPG-I plugin EndpointSlice watcher
from https://github.com/cloudnative-pg/cloudnative-pg/pull/10836. The
official 1.28.4 manifest includes the required get, list, and watch
permissions:
https://github.com/cloudnative-pg/cloudnative-pg/releases/download/v1.28.4/cnpg-1.28.4.yaml

Chart 0.27.1 predates this backport, and no 0.27.x chart containing the
permissions was published. The permissions first appear in chart
0.29.0; the published 0.28.x charts through 0.28.3 also lack them. The
missing chart backports are tracked at:
https://github.com/cloudnative-pg/charts/issues/939

Remove this patch when upgrading to a chart version that includes the
EndpointSlice permissions.
---
diff --git a/cloudnative-pg/templates/_helpers.tpl b/cloudnative-pg/templates/_helpers.tpl
--- a/cloudnative-pg/templates/_helpers.tpl
+++ b/cloudnative-pg/templates/_helpers.tpl
@@ -168,6 +168,14 @@ namespace scope or clusterwide
   - create
   - get
   - update
+- apiGroups:
+  - discovery.k8s.io
+  resources:
+  - endpointslices
+  verbs:
+  - get
+  - list
+  - watch
 - apiGroups:
   - monitoring.coreos.com
   resources:
